@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor black
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor black
}
actor "牙医" as A0
boundary "<u>:牙医接口</u>" as B0
control "<u>:维护长期健康资</u>\n<u>料及复核控制</u>" as K
participant "<u>:患者</u>" as Patient
participant "<u>:健康版本</u>" as HealthVersion
participant "<u>:健康条目</u>" as HealthItem
participant "<u>:就诊</u>" as Visit
participant "<u>:健康复核</u>" as Review
A0 -> B0 : 提交UC-21办理依据
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 协调UC-21办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> Patient : 核对临床访问(牙医及患者)
activate Patient
Patient --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Patient
opt 长期健康资料有变化
K -> Patient : 确认健康变更(病史、过敏、用药及来源)
activate Patient
Patient -> HealthVersion : 形成健康版本(原依据、原因、时间)
activate HealthVersion
HealthVersion -> HealthItem : 保留健康结论(类别、内容、有无或未知)
activate HealthItem
HealthItem --> HealthVersion : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate HealthItem
HealthVersion --> Patient : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate HealthVersion
Patient --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Patient
end
K -> Visit : 确认当次复核(所据版本、复核结论)
activate Visit
Visit -> Review : 保留复核快照(版本、牙医、时间)
activate Review
Review --> Visit : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Review
Visit --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Visit
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
note over K,Review
校验不通过时返回规约中的原因；
本阶段不留下部分有效结果。
end note

@enduml
